flowchart TD
  Upload[CSV or JSON input] --> Limits[Check size, format, row count]
  Limits --> Parse[Parse and normalize]
  Parse --> Validate[Validate fields and ownership]
  Validate --> Dedupe[External ID or fingerprint duplicate check]
  Dedupe --> Categorize[Manual override, user rule, system rule, uncategorized]
  Categorize --> Mode{Preview or commit?}
  Mode -->|Preview| Response[Return row results without business writes]
  Mode -->|Commit| Recheck[Revalidate and repeat duplicate checks]
  Recheck --> Persist[Persist within defined transaction boundary]
  Persist --> History[Record sanitized import history and row results]
